{"id":"560196b62ae7159f","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-fagin-1974.md","title":"Fagin定理 (1974)","display":"thm-fagin-1974 — Fagin定理 (1974)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-fagin-1974","aliases":["29-thm-fagin-1974"],"display":"thm-fagin-1974 — Fagin定理 (1974)","depends_on":["[[29-df-so-so-exists]]","[[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]","[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 7.8, p.115, DjVu scan 130","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-fagin-1974"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-fagin-1974</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fagin-1974 — Fagin定理 (1974)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd316f316437dd24\" href=\"?note=dd316f316437dd24\" title=\"29-df-so-so-exists\">29-df-so-so-exists</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8372f1f6b9135d87\" href=\"?note=8372f1f6b9135d87\" title=\"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics\">29-df-so-quantifier-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 7.8, p.115, DjVu scan 130"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NP}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{NP}[\\tau]\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a> 的同构不变布尔查询类。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^1[\\tau]\">\\(\\Sigma_1^1[\\tau]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\exists\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]\">\\(Q(\\exists\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dd316f316437dd24\" href=\"?note=dd316f316437dd24\" title=\"29-df-so-so-exists\">29-df-so-so-exists</a>；SO 满足使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8372f1f6b9135d87\" href=\"?note=8372f1f6b9135d87\" title=\"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics\">29-df-so-quantifier-semantics</a>。</li>\n<li>有限输入采用固定编码；外加的编码序不作为不变查询的输入关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NP}[\\tau]=Q(\\exists\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NP}[\\tau]=Q(\\exists\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 7.8，印刷页 115，扫描页 130。核对陈述及“猜测关系后求值 FO 矩阵”的上界证明；本次没有逐式重验 p.116–117 的配置表下界。删除对 P=NP 命题的错误依赖：此定理不需要假设或先定义该开放命题。旧的三个入口保留，语义依据集中到同一结果。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-so-so-exists","status":"resolved","id":"dd316f316437dd24","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-so-so-exists]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"8372f1f6b9135d87","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]","embed":fal